{"schemaVersion":3,"subjectId":"world-history-so","deckId":"deck-8","chunkNumber":1,"terms":[{"id":"WHSO-fd90fd1267dbd3db05de","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":149,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝について説明しなさい。","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":149},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-fd90fd1267dbd3db05de-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"サファヴィー朝について説明しなさい。","answer":"ティムール朝分裂後のイランで、サファヴィー教団の教主イスマーイール1世がトルコ系遊牧民キジルバシュの軍事力を背景にタブリーズで建国した王朝。ウズベク人を破ってイラン支配を固め、シーア派の十二イマーム派を国教として布教を進めた。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-5e78bea17e82d8d9c4d6","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":150,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝建国時に、イスマーイール1世を軍事的に支えたトルコ系遊牧民は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":150},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-5e78bea17e82d8d9c4d6-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"サファヴィー朝建国時に、イスマーイール1世を軍事的に支えたトルコ系遊牧民は？","answer":"キジルバシュ","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-f68d07481675fabd0a36","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":151,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"キジルバシュについて説明しなさい。","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":151},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-f68d07481675fabd0a36-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"キジルバシュについて説明しなさい。","answer":"サファヴィー教団を支持したトルコ系遊牧民で、イスマーイール1世のもとで軍事力の中核となり、サファヴィー朝建国を支えた集団。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-8559fcdec24daec54656","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":152,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝の君主が、イラン民族を結集してオスマン帝国に対抗するために名乗った伝統的な君主称号は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":152},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-8559fcdec24daec54656-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"サファヴィー朝の君主が、イラン民族を結集してオスマン帝国に対抗するために名乗った伝統的な君主称号は？","answer":"シャー","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-484457da3bcc515b4244","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":153,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"チャルディラーンの戦いについて説明しなさい。","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":153},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-484457da3bcc515b4244-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"チャルディラーンの戦いについて説明しなさい。","answer":"スンナ派のオスマン帝国とシーア派のサファヴィー朝がアゼルバイジャンをめぐって戦い、火器で武装したセリム1世のオスマン軍が勝利した戦い。サファヴィー朝は敗れてタブリーズを占領され、オスマン帝国は東アナトリアへ勢力を広げた。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-46353846697dcf6ce786","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":156,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝の第5代君主は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":156},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-46353846697dcf6ce786-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"サファヴィー朝の第5代君主は？","answer":"アッバース1世","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-252a6baf6304fff74e3d","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":157,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"アッバース1世について説明しなさい。","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":157},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-252a6baf6304fff74e3d-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"アッバース1世について説明しなさい。","answer":"サファヴィー朝第5代君主。キジルバシュ中心の軍制を改め、ゴラーム騎兵や火器部隊を整備して軍事力を強化し、オスマン帝国からアゼルバイジャン・イラク・タブリーズを奪回した。さらにポルトガルをホルムズ島から追放して交易路を確保し、イスファハーンへ遷都して中央集権化と商業振興を進め、サファヴィー朝を復興させた。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-4295325ccca43259bae5","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":158,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"ゴラームとは何か説明しなさい。","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":158},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-4295325ccca43259bae5-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"ゴラームとは何か説明しなさい。","answer":"サファヴィー朝で、グルジア人やアルメニア人などを奴隷身分から登用した軍人で、アッバース1世がキジルバシュに代わる軍事基盤として騎兵隊に編成した。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-d735caf4e3f71c9c0733","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":159,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"アッバース1世がキジルバシュへの依存を減らしてゴラームを重用したのはなぜ？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":159},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-d735caf4e3f71c9c0733-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"アッバース1世がキジルバシュへの依存を減らしてゴラームを重用したのはなぜ？","answer":"部族勢力であるキジルバシュの力を抑え、シャー直属の軍を整備して中央集権化を進めるため。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-7c487cc64cbe46f2609c","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":160,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝がポルトガルをホルムズ島から追い出す際、イギリスが協力したのはなぜ？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":160},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-7c487cc64cbe46f2609c-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"short_answer","label":"一問一答","prompt":"サファヴィー朝がポルトガルをホルムズ島から追い出す際、イギリスが協力したのはなぜ？","answer":"ポルトガルがペルシア湾交易を支配しており、イギリスにとっても商業上のライバルだったため、サファヴィー朝と利害が一致したから。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-73b692e378a6f00b38a6","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜08 サファヴィー","importanceRank":161,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"サファヴィー朝で、交易路の整備とともに増設された宿泊施設は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":161},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-73b692e378a6f00b38a6-B01","stage":"be